OL,3,GNEWSAKnife seized as armed officers
OL,4,Acalled to incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed police were deployed to an
OL,7,Fincident in Hull after reports of an
OL,8,Faltercation involving a knife.
OL,10,FThree people were arrested in the
OL,11,Foperation near the Crooked Billet pub
OL,12,Fon Holderness Road at about 14:15 BST
OL,13,Fon Monday.
OL,15,FHumberside Police said two men, aged 46
OL,16,Fand 40, and a 35-year-old woman, were
OL,17,Farrested at the scene on suspicion of
OL,18,Faffray.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
