OL,3,GNEWSAKnife seized as armed officers
OL,4,Acalled to incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Rich Mills said the incident
OL,7,Fwas believed to be "an isolated
OL,8,Fincident between individuals known to
OL,9,Feach other" with no wider risk to the
OL,10,Fpublic.
